{"id":"7665772637f98239","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-order9-scott-continuous-map.md","title":"ZFC Order9 Scott Continuous Map","display":"df-zfc-order9-scott-continuous-map — ZFC Order9 Scott Continuous Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order9-scott-continuous-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order9-scott-continuous-map"],"display":"df-zfc-order9-scott-continuous-map — ZFC Order9 Scott Continuous Map","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-poset-dcpo.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order9-scott-continuous-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order9-scott-continuous-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order9-scott-continuous-map — ZFC Order9 Scott Continuous Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd1bbc49a4004fb5\" href=\"?note=fd1bbc49a4004fb5\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-poset-dcpo.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-poset-dcpo.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q,\\leq_P,\\leq_Q,f\\in V\">\\(P,Q,\\leq_P,\\leq_Q,f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S(Q,\\leq_Q)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S(Q,\\leq_Q)\\)</span> (dcpo predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirectedSub}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{DirectedSub}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (nonempty directed-subset predicate defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeastUpperBound}_S(s,D,P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{LeastUpperBound}_S(s,D,P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (least-upper-bound predicate defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9ScottContinuousMap}_S(f,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9ScottContinuousMap}_S(f,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}scott\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirectedSub}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow D\\subseteq P\\land D\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\exists z\\in D\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}scott\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirectedSub}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow D\\subseteq P\\land D\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\exists z\\in D\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}scott\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{LeastUpperBound}_S(s,D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow s\\in P\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,s\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}scott\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{LeastUpperBound}_S(s,D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow s\\in P\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,s\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}scott\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder9ScottContinuousMap}_S(f,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,P,Q)\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\to\\langle f(x),f(y)\\rangle\\in\\leq_Q\\bigr)\\land\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;\\forall s\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{DirectedSub}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{LeastUpperBound}_S(s,D,P,\\leq_P)\\to\\mathrm{LeastUpperBound}_S(f(s),f[D],Q,\\leq_Q)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}scott\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder9ScottContinuousMap}_S(f,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,P,Q)\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\to\\langle f(x),f(y)\\rangle\\in\\leq_Q\\bigr)\\land\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;\\forall s\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{DirectedSub}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{LeastUpperBound}_S(s,D,P,\\leq_P)\\to\\mathrm{LeastUpperBound}_S(f(s),f[D],Q,\\leq_Q)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Scott continuity is monotonicity plus preservation of all nonempty directed suprema. Suprema are expressed by their universal property rather than by partial <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sup\">\\(\\sup\\)</span> terms.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-poset-dcpo.md","status":"resolved","id":"fd1bbc49a4004fb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-poset-dcpo.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,Q,\\leq_P,\\leq_Q,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S(Q,\\leq_Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirectedSub}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeastUpperBound}_S(s,D,P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9ScottContinuousMap}_S(f,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}scott\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirectedSub}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow D\\subseteq P\\land D\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\exists z\\in D\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}scott\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{LeastUpperBound}_S(s,D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow s\\in P\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,s\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\\forall d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\to\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}scott\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder9ScottContinuousMap}_S(f,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPosetDcpo}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\